{"symbol":"CBF.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:47:54Z","info":{"address1":"ul. Wierzbiecice 1B","city":"Poznan","zip":"61-569","country":"Poland","phone":"48 61 622 9018","website":"https://cyberfolks.pl","industry":"Information Technology Services","industryKey":"information-technology-services","industryDisp":"Information Technology Services","sector":"Technology","sectorKey":"technology","sectorDisp":"Technology","longBusinessSummary":"cyber_Folks S.A. operates as an e-commerce technology company in Europe. It operates through cyber_Folks, Vercom, and e-commerce segments. The cyber_Folks segment provides various solutions supporting the development of enterprises' online presence, including hosting services; and registration, sale, and transfer of domain names, as well as tools for building, operating, and scaling online stores and websites. The Vercom segment offers multi-channel communication services comprising text, multimedia, voice, and video messaging delivered through SMS, e-mail, push notifications, OTT, and other forms of digital communication. This segment also provides advanced functionalities, including content personalisation, data verification, message routing optimisation, communication encryption, and advanced reporting capabilities. Its solutions are used for transactional communication and for marketing activities. The e-commerce segment offers end-to-end technology infrastructure to support online sales. The company was formerly known as R22 S.A. and changed its name to cyber_Folks S.A. in August 2023. The company was founded in 1999 and is based in Poznan, Poland.","fullTimeEmployees":990,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Jakub  Dwernicki","title":"President of the Management Board & CEO","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":1837000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Robert  Stasik","title":"Vice President of the Management board","fiscalYear":2024,"totalPay":1427000,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedV